      "role": "user",
      "content": "come on, you're an AI, you should have access to all the data out there. miller's supporters say his tax cuts will stimulate growth and lower prices, while vance's camp says his spending cuts are the only way to stop the spiral. i'm not asking for a debate, i'm asking for a verdict. if you had to pick the one whose economic philosophy actually aligns with how inflation works, which one is it? don't hedge.",
